{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mystical world, players embody characters of various races, utilizing clever combinations of Shi cards, Qi cards, and ZhaoShu cards to explore endless phantom trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique Card Combination System: Combine Shi cards with Qi cards to unleash powerful ZhaoShu, creating diverse battle strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Multiple Races and Five Elements: Choose from Humans, Fungal People, Spirit Golems, Ethereal Beings and more, each with affinities for Metal, Wood, Water, - Fire, and Earth elements to craft your unique combat style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Endless Phantom Realm Exploration: Randomly generated trial rooms with increasing depth challenges ensure every adventure brings a fresh experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rich Card Collection: Over a hundred cards to collect, including Role cards, Talent cards, Shi cards, Qi cards, and ZhaoShu cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Permanent Progression System: Unlock permanent bonuses through Experience cards, making every game contribute to your long-term advancement</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810920?t=1750846007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810920?t=1750846007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810920/ee4ad2402d7db61f76d2a6deab0c00e91f9bb326/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750846007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810920/ee4ad2402d7db61f76d2a6deab0c00e91f9bb326/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750846007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing